    <briefdescription>
<para>A handle to a particular switch case. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It exposes a convenient interface to both the case value and the successor block.</para>
<para>We define this as a template and instantiate it to form both a const and non-const handle. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
